# Dropdown display layout (nav switchers)

Locale / theme (and similar header) switchers compose `@bokdy/ui` **Popover + Command + Button** (classic shadcn combobox). In admin-web, reuse `PopoverCommandSelect` `variant="nav"` — Bokdy chip chrome (sky primary / border / popover), not zinc panels.

Do not add a Combobox primitive under `packages/ui/src/ui/`.

## Trigger

- Chip: `rounded-lg border border-border bg-background`, `px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-foreground`
- Hover: `border-primary/40`, `bg-muted/60`
- Open: `border-primary`, `ring-2 ring-primary/20`
- Leading: icon or Twemoji `Emoji` from `@bokdy/ui` (common chrome)
- Label: `hidden sm:inline` (mobile = icon only)
- Trailing: `ChevronDown` (size ~14); muted by default, `text-primary` when open

## Panel

- `w-auto`, at least trigger width, `max-w-[14rem]`, `rounded-xl`, `border-border`, `bg-popover`, `shadow-lg`
- Align end
- No `zinc-*` / black-white opacity rings; override Popover default `w-72`

## Row

- Leading → label (`flex-1`) → **`Check` only when selected** (right)
- Hover / keyboard: `bg-muted`
- Selected value: `bg-primary/10 text-primary` + check `text-primary`
- Optional soft pink: leading `group-hover:text-accent`

## a11y

- Trigger: `aria-haspopup`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-label`
- Selected option: check + highlight

Do not hand-roll `useState` + absolute `<ul>` for these switchers — compose Popover + Command.
